<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Recoil reduction for most guns</Major>
    <Description>Bind to left mouse button (fire button)
800 dpi mouse (can be a little higher or lower)
8-12 horizontal
12 verticle
50 ads (default)
1920x1080 (1600x900 should work fine)
16:10 (All should work)
 For all guns with acogs besides guns with extremely low recoil like caps and blackbeards guns.
Message me if you have any troubles.
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
